# NOT EXPRESSED:
    function vprintf: a va_list
    function powl: long double
    function make_pt: a structure result
    function take_pt: a structure passed by value
    function mystery_t_fn: a parameter without a type
    function mystery_ret: the unknown type name unknown_t
    structure bits: a bit field
    structure uni: a union
    structure un2: a union
    structure packed_s: a packed or aligned attribute
    structure flexi: a flexible array member
    structure with_ld: long double
    structure usesinc: a member whose structure is incomplete or cannot be expressed
    structure sz_len: an array whose length is not a number, a sum or a product of numbers
    structure fwd_user: a member whose structure is incomplete or cannot be expressed
    structure under: a member named _, which IMP72 reads as an operator
    enumerator ODD: its value is not a simple number
    enumerator F_D: its value is not a simple number
#
